{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>To teach you to do.</b> For the main purpose of learning is to do the commandments." "<b>That you may live.</b> For those who served Peor were destroyed." "<b>And you shall possess.</b> Because of the construct state the yod of וירשתם is gone, the vav of the hif'il is broken, and the ayin is absent according to its pattern."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {2 "The argument is compressed: Ibn Ezra addresses why וירשתם lacks expected consonants (yod, vav, ayin) of a full hif'il form; 'according to its pattern' refers to the standard hif'il paradigm. Translated hyper-literally without expanding the morphology."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:22:12.416987838Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}